        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion E-D6, Victorian Entry Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade in the ornate style that is associated with the Victorian Era, Fusion Hardware's keyed entry plate is a great way to add elegance to your home. It is detailed enough to draw attention to its opulence but it is not overly gaudy. Customizable, it is available with your choice of knob or lever and any of 6 beautiful finishes. It will fit any door thickness form 1-3/8 inches up to 2 inches and is available in both 2-3/8 inch and 2-3/4 inch backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/clawfoot-lever-with-victorian-plate-fusion-ah-d6\"><b>Matching Clawfoot Lever With Victorian Plate</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/venetian-lever-with-victorian-plate-fusion-bd-d6\"><b>Matching Venetian Lever With Victorian Plate</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Ornate Solid Brass Fusion E-D6 Entry Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid brass forging and casting.</li>\r\n<li>Bump resistant cylinder.</li> \r\n<li>Solid brass SCI keyway and 5 pin system with self lubricating solid brass plug & housing.</li>\r\n<li>High security strike.</li> \r\n<li> Reversible latch bolts for inside and outside swing.</li>\r\n<li>Minimal parts for easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>Matching latch, strike and screws for excellent appearance.</li>\r\n<li>Beveled interior screws with single slot for improved visual.</li>\r\n<li>No unsightly or difficult-to-inset set screws are used.</li>\r\n<li>Dual spring assist that eliminates \"knob wobble\".</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Fusion Victorian Style Entry Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Center Door Boring: 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: 2-3/8\" and 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is operated by a key on the outside and a thumb turn on the inside while the latch underneath the deadbolt is operated by a turn knob on both the inside and the outside.</li>\r\n<br>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> This is a non-functional piece for looks only used to match trim for inactive door. It does not latch and it does not lock.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The finish for the inside knob or lever you choose will match the outside finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Victorian Entry Plate, Fusion E-D6",
                "description": "Victorian Style Keyed Entry Plate Fusion E-D6 - Made in the ornate style that is associated with the Victorian Era, Fusion Hardware's keyed entry plate is a great way to add elegance to your home. It is detailed enough to draw attention to its opulence but it is not overly gaudy. Customizable, it is available with your choice of knob or lever and any of 6 beautiful finishes. It will fit any door thickness form 1-3/8 inches up to 2 inches and is available in both 2-3/8 inch and 2-3/4 inch backsets",
